{
  "lines": {
    "cordelia_4_a": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. Come round the back a moment. I have wanted to show you something.",
    "cordelia_4_b": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. That is my sewing machine. It was my mother's, and it still runs true.",
    "cordelia_4_c": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. Feed in a bolt of cloth, set something on the spool, and see what comes out.",
    "cordelia_4_d": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. The dye pots are beside it. Use them whenever the shop is open.",
    "cordelia_2_a": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. Matches a hat to the player's face.",
    "cordelia_2_b": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. Do you have a moment?",
    "cordelia_2_ans1": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. Of course.",
    "cordelia_2_ans2": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. I should be going, but go on.",
    "cordelia_2_r1": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. Thank you. That means a lot.",
    "cordelia_2_r2": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. Then I will be quick.",
    "cordelia_2_c": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. Here, I want you to have this.",
    "cordelia_6_a": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. A hat for a festival, the player picks the trim.",
    "cordelia_6_b": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. Do you have a moment?",
    "cordelia_6_ans1": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. Of course.",
    "cordelia_6_ans2": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. I should be going, but go on.",
    "cordelia_6_r1": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. Thank you. That means a lot.",
    "cordelia_6_r2": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. Then I will be quick.",
    "cordelia_6_c": "PLACEHOLDER TEXT. Here, I want you to have this."
  },
